### 1. 创建新分析任务
POST http://localhost:8000/api/edu-insights/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "exams": ["2025-DIST-M-202301", "2025-DIST-M-202307", "2025-DIST-M-202401", "2025-DIST-M-202407", "2025-DIST-M-202501"],
  "subject": "MATH",
  "model": ["student_cluster"],
  "clusters": 12,
  "min_exams": 5,
  "visualize_clusters": true
}

### 2. 查询任务状态（替换TASK_ID为实际ID）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/edu-insights/tasks/2103ebc1-43f5-4350-a326-cbce9330cf6d/status/
Accept: application/json

### 3. 获取任务结果（替换TASK_ID为实际ID）
GET http://localhost:8000/api/edu-insights/tasks/2103ebc1-43f5-4350-a326-cbce9330cf6d/results/
Accept: application/json

### 4. 获取所有任务列表
GET http://localhost:8000/api/edu-insights/tasks/
Accept: application/json

# 查询可用的考试记录
from core.models import Exam
exams = Exam.objects.all()
print("可用考试:", [(exam.id, exam.name) for exam in exams[:10]])